OL,3,GNEWSAStudents use video game to review 
OL,4,Acouncil plans                          
OL,6,FStudents have been reviewing proposals 
OL,7,Fto regenerate a town by playing a video
OL,8,Fgame.                                  
OL,10,FTeenagers at Gateshead College have    
OL,11,Fbeen exploring a virtual version of    
OL,12,FGateshead and offering their feedback  
OL,13,Fon proposed changes.                   
OL,15,FThe game has been created by planning  
OL,16,Ffirm Digital Urban, which allows users 
OL,17,Fto walk through the town centre while  
OL,18,Fviewing plans through a virtual reality
OL,19,Fheadset.                               
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
