OL,3,GNEWSAStudents use video game to review 
OL,4,Acouncil plans                          
OL,6,FFounder of Digital Urban Simon Mabey   
OL,7,Fsaid: "Asking for feedback from young  
OL,8,Fpeople shouldn't feel like homework and
OL,9,Fhopefully through this they get a      
OL,10,Fbetter idea of the plans for           
OL,11,FGateshead."                            
